        "localization": {
          "name": "Netherworld Mist",
          "description": "Grants all non-poisoned enemies the Cursed Sleep status effect for 200TU. Then grants all non-sleeping enemies the Mega Poison status effect for 200TU. This will overwrite other status effects on those units.\n\nThen if any enemy on the battlefield is not sleeping and not poisoned (e.g. due to Wards), the user will immediately get the next turn and become Enraged. This will overwrite the effects of other Enrage skills on the user.\n\nUsable only if the user has a Power Charge. Consumes a Power Charge\n\nCursed Sleep will overwrite status effects other than Burn, cannot be overwritten by Poison, can be applied repeatedly to units that have already slept while on the battlefield, and will not end from damage caused by Dream Hunter type active skills. Mega Poison deals 20 times the damage of normal Poison and cannot be overwritten by normal Poison or Super Poison. Enraged units have their Attack increased to 1.5x until the end of their next turn.",
