        "localization": {
          "name": "Wrathful Revenant",
          "description": "This unit can't have its Active Skills disabled by enemy passive skills.\n\nThis unit cannot be stunned or be sent to the reinforcements from the battlefield.\n\nThis unit enters battle Fortified, and with a Sleep Ward, Poison Ward, and an Instant Death Ward.\n\nThe first time this unit is damaged by an enemy attack while not burning, this unit will have its TU reduced to 0.\n\nThis unit's attacks will not wake sleeping enemies, ignore damage reduction effects, and any effects of non-boss enemies that would prevent targets from being defeated.\n\nEach Ward prevents their named effect from being applied once, then is removed. Identical Wards cannot stack. An Instant Death Ward prevents this unit from being immediately defeated without damage by a non-boss enemy once, then is removed. Instant Death Wards cannot be ignored and cannot stack."
        }
      },
