        "id": "BattlePassiveALuBuDark",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Returned Soul",
          "description": "This unit has 50% damage reduction from attacks while there is a poisoned or sleeping enemy on the battlefield.\n\nIf this unit would be defeated by an enemy attack or a status effect while having more than 1 HP, it instead survives with 1 HP.\n\nEach time this unit takes damage from an attack and survives until after the end of the turn, this unit will heal for 50% of its max HP.\n\nWhenever another unit (ally or enemy) enters the battlefield from reinforcements, this unit is granted an Instant Death Ward and will be healed for 100% of its max HP."
        }
